# Local `expo run:android` lets React Native's Gradle plugin strip the legacy
# package="…" attribute from library manifests in node_modules, in place. EAS installs
# untouched copies, so counting these files makes the fingerprint (runtime version)
# differ between this Mac and EAS and the cloud build fails at "Configure expo-updates".
node_modules/**/android/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
